          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todayに表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to your Canvas or Google calendar, and its events appear in Kitbag and stay up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CanvasやGoogleカレンダーを購読すると，予定がKitbagに表示され，最新の状態に保たれます．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscriptions": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "購読"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscriptions…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "購読…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a calendar address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カレンダーのアドレスではありません．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address could not be read from the keychain.": {
      "comment": "Shown when a calendar subscription address cannot be stored in or read from the keychain.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キーチェーンからアドレスを読み取れませんでした．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address works like a password, so Kitbag keeps it in the keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアドレスはパスワードのように扱われるため，Kitbagはキーチェーンに保存します．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deadlines could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "締め切りを保存できませんでした．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved deadlines could not be read. They were kept as a separate file and a new list was started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されていた締め切りを読み込めませんでした．別のファイルとして残し，新しい一覧を始めました．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server answered %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーの応答: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no events in that calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このカレンダーに予定がありません．"
